@kind(api)

@meta{crate: tomet-search, dependencies: list(tomet-ast, tomet-parser, tomet-semantics, tomet-tree), dependents: list(tomet-load, tomet-transform, tomet-vault, tomet-workspace)}

=[tomet-search]

==[tomet-search]

Pure, in-memory search and query engine for Tomet documents.

==[Scope & Layering]

Performs pure, in-memory querying and matching without filesystem I/O.
Filesystem scanning and disk caching belong to higher layers
(`tomet-workspace-indexer` and `tomet-workspace`).

==[Query Engines]

- ("`structural`") AST element query matching by tag, key, and value content.

Querying documents by their metadata is not done here: it is an expression
(`vault.docs.filter(d => ...)`), evaluated by `tomet-expr`.

==[Module structural]

Structural AST query matching.

Provides pure in-memory querying over Tomet AST elements by tag,
attribute/property key, and value content.

===[Structs]

====[struct StructuralQuery]

Criteria for matching AST elements.

====[struct StructuralMatch]

A matched AST element occurrence with its span and tag name.

===[Functions]

====[fn matches_query]

Checks if a single element matches `query`.

====[fn count_structural_matches]

Counts matching elements in `doc` for `query`.

====[fn find_structural_matches]

Finds all matching element occurrences in `doc` for `query`.
